- Level 2: Watchdog 🔍 (3-5min)    → HTTP health checks + exponential backoff
- Level 3: AI Doctor 🧠 (5-30min)  → Case-based diagnosis + auto-fix
- Level 4: Human Alert 🚨          → Lark/DingTalk notification with full context
